            3. The 6 Best Whey Protein Concentrates
          </h2>

          <p>
            Every pick below is either a straight whey protein concentrate or a blend whose first-listed protein is concentrate. Cost per 25 g of protein uses the retailer price and serving count we found in early November 2026 and the label protein figure; both change, so treat the numbers as a snapshot rather than a quote. Label figures are per the label at the time of writing and vary by flavor.
          </p>

          {PRODUCTS.map((product, index) => (
            <ProductCard product={product} rank={index + 1} />
