          <p>
            So the value case for concentrate is real but conditional. It is strongest when you compare like with like: a flavored concentrate against a flavored isolate from a similar tier of brand. It is weakest when you pick a premium concentrate, such as Puori's batch-tested PW1, against a no-frills isolate. Grass-fed claims, single-serve packs and small tubs all push the price up faster than the choice of concentrate or isolate does.
